🔴 **CRITICAL:** `delete_project` (DELETE /projects/<pid>) has no authentication or authorization check, while the `get_project` handler directly above it is protected with `@require_auth`. Any unauthenticated caller who can reach this route can delete any project by enumerating `pid` values, causing irreversible data loss. Add `@require_auth` (plus any ownership check) to match the GET handler.

```suggestion
@require_auth
def delete_project(pid: str):
```
